le, with the caller supplied through get_verified_user.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-36004c253fb01743","startLine":1,"endLine":6}]},{"id":"f-source-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"For a non-admin caller, the file is retrieved by file ID together with user.id, providing the visible source-file ownership check.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-36004c253fb01743","startLine":14,"endLine":19}]},{"id":"f-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The caller-supplied collection_name is selected and passed as the destination collection_name to the save operation.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-36004c253fb01743","startLine":21,"endLine":24},{"sourceId":"src-36004c253fb01743","startLine":149,"endLine":160}]},{"id":"f-auth-control","kind":"control","statement":"The visible authorization distinction is admin versus non-admin file lookup; the non-admin lookup constrains access to the source file by user.id, and the supplied source shows no destination ownership or write-grant check before the save call.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-36004c253fb01743","startLine":14,"endLine":19}]},{"id":"f-protected-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"save_docs_to_vector_db is invoked with the constructed file documents, the caller-selected collection_name, and add=True when form_data.collection_name is supplied, providing the destination write path for the file content.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-36004c253fb01743","startLine":149,"endLine":160}]},{"id":"f-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"When form_data.content is supplied, it is placed into a Document as page_content; otherwise the file's stored or loaded content is placed into documents before the save call.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-36004c253fb01743","startLine":26,"endLine":50},{"sourceId":"src-36004c253fb01743","startLine":67,"endLine":81},{"sourceId":"src-36004c253fb01743","startLine":83,"endLine":118}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":3979,"output":1017,"cacheRe